The SVG files in this directory are unmodified copies of symbolic icons of the
Adwaita icon theme (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme) by the
GNOME Project, https://www.gnome.org. They are used to draw the system symbols
that have no drawing of their own in NSImageSymbolGlyphs.m.

This work is licenced under the terms of either the GNU LGPL v3 or
Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 United States License.
To view a copy of the CC-BY-SA licence, visit
http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

